<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Akeem Oyebanji | Senior DevSecOps Engineer</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #0b0f19;
            --card: #131a2b;
            --text: #e2e8f0;
            --muted: #94a3b8;
            --primary: #22d3ee;
            --secondary: #a855f7;
            --accent: #f97316;
            --success: #34d399;
            --gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #22d3ee, #a855f7, #f97316);
            --shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* Animated background */
        .bg-shapes {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            z-index: -1;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .shape {
            position: absolute;
            border-radius: 50%;
            filter: blur(80px);
            opacity: 0.15;
            animation: float 20s infinite ease-in-out;
        }

        .shape1 { width: 400px; height: 400px; background: var(--primary); top: -100px; left: -100px; }
        .shape2 { width: 300px; height: 300px; background: var(--secondary); top: 40%; right: -50px; animation-delay: -5s; }
        .shape3 { width: 350px; height: 350px; background: var(--accent); bottom: -100px; left: 30%; animation-delay: -10s; }

        @keyframes float {
            0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0); }
            50% { transform: translate(30px, -30px); }
        }

        /* Navigation */
        nav {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 1.2rem 5%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            background: rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            z-index: 1000;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
        }

        .logo {
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            background: var(--gradient);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 2rem;
            list-style: none;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            color: var(--muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: color 0.3s;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        /* Hero */
        .hero {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 5%;
            padding-top: 80px;
        }

        .hero-content {
            max-width: 800px;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.15);
            color: var(--primary);
            padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.3);
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.1;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .hero h1 span {
            background: var(--gradient);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .hero .title {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            color: var(--primary);
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            color: var(--muted);
            max-width: 600px;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
        }

        .cta-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn {
            padding: 0.9rem 1.8rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--gradient);
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.3);
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.4);
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--text);
            border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            border-color: var(--primary);
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        /* Sections */
        section {
            padding: 6rem 5%;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .section-title span {
            background: var(--gradient);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        /* About */
        .about-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr;
            gap: 4rem;
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .about-card {
            background: var(--card);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 2.5rem;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        }

        .about-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        .about-text p {
            color: var(--muted);
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
        }

        /* Skills */
        .skills-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .skill-card {
            background: var(--card);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 1.8rem;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            transition: transform 0.3s, border-color 0.3s;
        }

        .skill-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            border-color: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.3);
        }

        .skill-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.6rem;
        }

        .skill-tags {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        .tag {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
            color: var(--muted);
            padding: 0.35rem 0.8rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .tag.primary { background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.15); color: var(--primary); }
        .tag.secondary { background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.15); color: var(--secondary); }
        .tag.accent { background: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.15); color: var(--accent); }
        .tag.success { background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.15); color: var(--success); }

        /* Experience */
        .timeline {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            position: relative;
        }

        .timeline::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: 20px;
            top: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            width: 2px;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
        }

        .timeline-item {
            position: relative;
            padding-left: 60px;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .timeline-item::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: 12px;
            top: 5px;
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--primary);
            border: 4px solid var(--bg);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.3);
        }

        .timeline-item h3 {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
        }

        .timeline-item .company {
            color: var(--primary);
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .timeline-item .date {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        }

        .timeline-item p {
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        /* Projects */
        .projects-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .project-card {
            background: var(--card);
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }

        .project-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
        }

        .project-header {
            height: 8px;
            background: var(--gradient);
        }

        .project-body {
            padding: 1.8rem;
        }

        .project-body h3 {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
        }

        .project-body p {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
        }

        /* Contact */
        .contact-section {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .contact-section p {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
        }

        .contact-links {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .contact-link {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.6rem;
            background: var(--card);
            padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 14px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--text);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            transition: all 0.3s;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .contact-link:hover {
            border-color: var(--primary);
            color: var(--primary);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2.5rem 5%;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .nav-links { display: none; }
            .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
            .hero { padding-top: 120px; }
            .timeline::before { left: 12px; }
            .timeline-item { padding-left: 45px; }
            .timeline-item::before { left: 4px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="bg-shapes">
        <div class="shape shape1"></div>
        <div class="shape shape2"></div>
        <div class="shape shape3"></div>
    </div>

    <nav>
        <div class="logo">AO</div>
        <ul class="nav-links">
            <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
            <li><a href="#skills">Skills</a></li>
            <li><a href="#experience">Experience</a></li>
            <li><a href="#projects">Projects</a></li>
            <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <div class="badge">Available for opportunities</div>
            <h1>Hi, I'm <span>Akeem Oyebanji</span></h1>
            <div class="title">Senior DevSecOps Engineer</div>
            <p>
                I design and secure cloud-native platforms that scale. Passionate about automating security, 
                building resilient infrastructure, and bridging the gap between development and operations 
                with a security-first mindset.
            </p>
            <div class="cta-buttons">
                <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get In Touch</a>
                <a href="#projects" class="btn btn-secondary">View Projects</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- About -->
    <section id="about">
        <h2 class="section-title">About <span>Me</span></h2>
        <div class="about-grid">
            <div class="about-card">
                <h3>Who I Am</h3>
                <p style="color: var(--muted);">
                    A results-driven Senior DevSecOps Engineer with deep expertise in cloud security, 
                    infrastructure as code, and CI/CD pipelines. I help teams ship faster while staying secure.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="about-text">
                <p>
                    With a strong foundation in both development and security, I specialize in embedding security 
                    into every stage of the software delivery lifecycle. My work focuses on cloud platforms 
                    (AWS, Azure, GCP), container security, policy-as-code, and building highly automated, 
                    observable systems.
                </p>
                <p>
                    I thrive in fast-paced environments where I can mentor teams, implement zero-trust architectures, 
                    and continuously improve reliability and security posture.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Skills -->
    <section id="skills">
        <h2 class="section-title">Skills & <span>Expertise</span></h2>
        <div class="skills-grid">
            <div class="skill-card">
                <h3>☁️ Cloud Platforms</h3>
                <div class="skill-tags">
                    <span class="tag primary">AWS</span>
                    <span class="tag primary">Azure</span>
                    <span class="tag primary">GCP</span>
                    <span class="tag">Kubernetes</span>
                    <span class="tag">EKS / AKS / GKE</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="skill-card">
                <h3>🔐 Security & Compliance</h3>
                <div class="skill-tags">
                    <span class="tag secondary">DevSecOps</span>
                    <span class="tag secondary">SAST / DAST</span>
                    <span class="tag secondary">Policy as Code</span>
                    <span class="tag">Zero Trust</span>
                    <span class="tag">OWASP</span>
                    <span class="tag">CIS Benchmarks</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="skill-card">
                <h3>⚙️ Infrastructure as Code</h3>
                <div class="skill-tags">
                    <span class="tag accent">Terraform</span>
                    <span class="tag accent">Pulumi</span>
                    <span class="tag">CloudFormation</span>
                    <span class="tag">Ansible</span>
                    <span class="tag">Helm</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="skill-card">
                <h3>🚀 CI/CD & Automation</h3>
                <div class="skill-tags">
                    <span class="tag success">GitHub Actions</span>
                    <span class="tag success">GitLab CI</span>
                    <span class="tag">Jenkins</span>
                    <span class="tag">ArgoCD</span>
                    <span class="tag">Docker</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="skill-card">
                <h3>📊 Observability</h3>
                <div class="skill-tags">
                    <span class="tag">Prometheus</span>
                    <span class="tag">Grafana</span>
                    <span class="tag">ELK Stack</span>
                    <span class="tag">Datadog</span>
                    <span class="tag">OpenTelemetry</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="skill-card">
                <h3>💻 Languages & Tools</h3>
                <div class="skill-tags">
                    <span class="tag">Python</span>
                    <span class="tag">Bash</span>
                    <span class="tag">Go</span>
                    <span class="tag">Linux</span>
                    <span class="tag">Git</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Experience -->
    <section id="experience">
        <h2 class="section-title">Work <span>Experience</span></h2>
        <div class="timeline">
            <div class="timeline-item">
                <h3>Senior DevSecOps Engineer</h3>
                <div class="company">Your Company Name</div>
                <div class="date">2023 – Present</div>
                <p>
                    Leading cloud security and platform engineering initiatives. Designed secure multi-account 
                    AWS architectures, implemented automated security scanning in CI/CD, and reduced critical 
                    vulnerabilities by 70%. Mentored engineers on secure coding and infrastructure practices.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline-item">
                <h3>DevOps Engineer</h3>
                <div class="company">Previous Company</div>
                <div class="date">2021 – 2023</div>
                <p>
                    Built and maintained Kubernetes platforms, automated infrastructure with Terraform, 
                    and integrated security tools into delivery pipelines. Improved deployment frequency 
                    and system reliability across production environments.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline-item">
                <h3>Cloud Engineer</h3>
                <div class="company">Earlier Role</div>
                <div class="date">2019 – 2021</div>
                <p>
                    Managed cloud infrastructure, implemented monitoring and logging solutions, 
                    and supported migration of legacy systems to cloud-native architectures.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Projects -->
    <section id="projects">
        <h2 class="section-title">Featured <span>Projects</span></h2>
        <div class="projects-grid">
            <div class="project-card">
                <div class="project-header"></div>
                <div class="project-body">
                    <h3>Secure Multi-Account Cloud Platform</h3>
                    <p>
                        Designed and implemented a highly secure, multi-account AWS landing zone using 
                        Terraform and AWS Control Tower with automated guardrails and centralized logging.
                    </p>
                    <div class="skill-tags">
                        <span class="tag primary">AWS</span>
                        <span class="tag accent">Terraform</span>
                        <span class="tag secondary">Security</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="project-card">
                <div class="project-header"></div>
                <div class="project-body">
                    <h3>DevSecOps CI/CD Pipeline</h3>
                    <p>
                        Built end-to-end pipelines with integrated SAST, DAST, container scanning, 
                        and policy-as-code checks. Reduced security debt and accelerated secure releases.
                    </p>
                    <div class="skill-tags">
                        <span class="tag success">GitHub Actions</span>
                        <span class="tag secondary">Trivy</span>
                        <span class="tag">OPA</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="project-card">
                <div class="project-header"></div>
                <div class="project-body">
                    <h3>Kubernetes Security Hardening</h3>
                    <p>
                        Implemented zero-trust networking, pod security standards, runtime protection, 
                        and continuous compliance scanning across production Kubernetes clusters.
                    </p>
                    <div class="skill-tags">
                        <span class="tag primary">Kubernetes</span>
                        <span class="tag secondary">Falco</span>
                        <span class="tag">Kyverno</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Contact -->
    <section id="contact">
        <div class="contact-section">
            <h2 class="section-title">Let's <span>Connect</span></h2>
            <p>
                I'm always open to discussing new opportunities, interesting projects, 
                or just chatting about cloud security and DevSecOps.
            </p>
            <div class="contact-links">
                <a href="mailto:akeem.oyebanji@example.com" class="contact-link">
                    ✉️ Email
                </a>
                <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/akeemoyebanji" class="contact-link" target="_blank">
                    💼 LinkedIn
                </a>
                <a href="https://github.com/akeemoyebanji" class="contact-link" target="_blank">
                    🐙 GitHub
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>© 2026 Akeem Oyebanji · Senior DevSecOps Engineer</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
